<!-- ALIVE mark: a flame, on the same 16x16 grid as every sprite.

     Ink contour with a gold fill, the way the streak pips beside it are drawn,
     because it sits on the pale-gold tile: a gold flame on gold paper would be
     a smudge, and the ink edge is what every other shape on that tile already
     has. The tip leans right so it reads as fire rather than as a leaf. -->
